<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.recovery.enrols ~ one typed event the face's own key signs

`lares persona recovery-contact enrol <index> threshold=<k> <offer>…` enrols the face's first recovery contact set by one typed event its own key signs, refusing a key another face holds. The rule asks for a threshold of two over three offers: three people each hold a recovery key for one face, and two of the three, together, restore your Handle (your Handle: the public card your face publishes, recognised by its own key). A recovery contact restores your Handle; a custodian card of a `split-root=true` returns your memory, and neither stands in for the other.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ enrol

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`enrol` params=`index/1 threshold/2 offers/[[<offer> <offer> <offer>]] ~ enrol three contacts at two of three`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ index · threshold · offers

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`index` params=`takes/handle-index needs/required seat/1 as/<index> ~ the face's handle index, a whole number from 0`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`threshold` params=`takes/count needs/required ~ how many contacts recover the face`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`offers` params=`takes/lines needs/required seat/2 as/<offer…> ~ the contacts' offer lines`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/face-root ~ signs under the face's own key`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.recovery.enrols index/1 threshold/2 offers/<offer>]] ~ no number for threshold=, no offers, or an index out of range`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ enrolled

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`enrolled` params=`exit/0 ~ the event landed`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares persona recovery-contact enrol

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares persona recovery-contact enrol]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

